countdown label ok loopKind none
countdown label ok within none
countdown let zero immutable Int64 0
countdown let two immutable Int64 2
countdown at begin do isZero
countdown at begin branch if atZero goto finished else goto checkSign
countdown at finished return ok zero
countdown at checkSign do isNegative
countdown at checkSign branch if negative goto fail else goto step
